<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech rev repo yields average/maximum 18.5 pct.</title>
<headline>Czech rev repo yields average/maximum 18.5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Average yield in a Czech National Bank one-week reverse repo, was the same as the maximum set limit on bids of 18.5 percent, the CNB said.</p>
<p>It said that it accepted 100 percent of bids made at that level, but total volume on the transactions was not released.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 420-2-2423-0003</p>
</text>
